    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Condition · Urological emergency\",\"title\":\"Paraphimosis\",\"lede\":\"Paraphimosis occurs when a retracted foreskin becomes trapped behind the head of the penis and cannot be brought forward again. Swelling can increase quickly and the condition may require urgent treatment.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidar\\u0022\\u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)\\u003c/a\\u003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Reasons\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\"},{\"label\":\"Paraphimosis\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If this is happening now, do not wait for a routine clinic appointment. Seek urgent medical assessment, particularly if swelling is increasing, the colour is changing, pain is severe or the patient cannot pass urine.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>After the immediate problem has been treated, some patients may be advised to consider circumcision to reduce the risk of recurrence. See <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\">phimosis</a>, <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/\">adult circumcision</a> and <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\">aftercare</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/callout {\"title\":\"Request a consultation\",\"body\":\"\\u003cdiv data-reveal\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eBeing seen\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n        \\r\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022 style=\\u0022margin-top:20px\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003cp\\u003eYou can request a consultation or book by contacting the clinic. If you are booking for a child, please read the identification and consent requirements before attending. Tell us about any medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems when you book.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022btn-row\\u0022 style=\\u0022margin-top:26px\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022book-condition\\u0022\\u003eBook a consultation\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003ca class=\\u0022btn btn-ghost\\u0022 href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-condition\\u0022\\u003eCall 020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cdiv style=\\u0022margin-top:26px\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022callout urgent\\u0022 data-reveal\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022display d-3\\u0022\\u003eIf this is urgent, do not wait for an appointment\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eGo to A\\u0026amp;E today if a pulled-back foreskin is trapped behind the head of the penis and swelling, if you or your child cannot pass urine, or if there is spreading redness with a fever. Those need treating in hours. For anything else, call \\u003ca href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-urgent\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep);font-weight:600\\u0022\\u003e020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e and tell us what is happening, and we will bring you forward if you need it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"urgent\":true,\"level\":2} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Describe it to us\",\"formId\":\"paraphimosis\",\"subject\":\"paraphimosis enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Book a consultation\",\"text\":\"You can request a consultation or book by contacting the clinic. Tell us about any medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems when you book.\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->"
